
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ForceMouselook(Enable: boolean)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llForceMouselook(integer Enable);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets if a sitting avatar should be forced into <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Mouselook" target="_blank">mouselook</a> when they sit on this prim.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Enable / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">mouselook</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a>, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> when an avatar sits on the prim, the avatar will be forced into <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Mouselook" target="_blank">mouselook</a> mode, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a>&amp;#32;(default) the avatar will keep their current camera mode.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>avatar</li>
        <li>camera</li>
        <li>permissions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">294</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>A <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSitTarget" target="_blank">sit target</a> is not necessary for this function to work.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function has no effect on avatars already seated.</li>
    <li>The user may exit mouselook mode at any time.
    <ul>
      <li>This can be detected by polling <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentInfo" target="_blank">llGetAgentInfo</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
    <li>There is nothing stopping someone from modifying or making a client that ignores this.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p><b>Force Mouselook on Sit</b></p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    ll.ForceMouselook(true)  -- Forces sitting avatars into mouselook.

    ll.ForceMouselook(false)  -- Reverts the setting to the default...
-- ...as with a newly created prim.
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        llForceMouselook(TRUE); // Forces sitting avatars into mouselook.

        llForceMouselook(FALSE); // Reverts the setting to the default...
                                 // ...as with a newly created prim.
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
